  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Tip Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Tip Calculator</h1>\n    <form id=\"tip-form\" class=\"form\">\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"bill\">Bill amount ($)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"bill\" name=\"bill\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"0.00\" required>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label>Tip percentage</label>\n        <div class=\"tip-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tip percentage\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"10\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10%</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"15\" aria-pressed=\"false\">15%</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"20\" aria-pressed=\"false\">20%</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"people\">Number of people</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"people\" name=\"people\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" required>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n    <section class=\"results\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span class=\"result-label\">Tip per person</span>\n        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"tip-per-person\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span class=\"result-label\">Total per person</span>\n        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"total-per-person\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with form inputs and result display."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card-bg: #16213e;\n  --primary: #e94560;\n  --secondary: #0f3460;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --accent: #f5c542;\n  --pixel-size: 4px;\n  --font: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: \n    linear-gradient(45deg, var(--secondary) 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--secondary) 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, var(--secondary) 75%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, var(--secondary) 75%);\n  background-size: 20px 20px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 0 10px, 10px -10px, -10px 0px;\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: var(--pixel-size) solid var(--primary);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--secondary);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--secondary);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.form {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"] {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: var(--pixel-size) solid var(--secondary);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  padding: 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.1s;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n}\n\n.tip-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn {\n  flex: 1;\n  background: var(--secondary);\n  border: var(--pixel-size) solid var(--primary);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  padding: 12px 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--bg);\n}\n\n.tip-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\n.tip-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:active,\n.tip-btn[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--bg);\n}\n\n.results {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  border-top: var(--pixel-size) solid var(--secondary);\n  padding-top: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.result-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.result-value {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--secondary);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  .tip-btn {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-art themed styling with responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const billInput = document.getElementById('bill');\n  const peopleInput = document.getElementById('people');\n  const tipButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.tip-btn');\n  const tipPerPersonEl = document.getElementById('tip-per-person');\n  const totalPerPersonEl = document.getElementById('total-per-person');\n\n  let selectedTip = 0;\n\n  function formatCurrency(amount) {\n    return '$' + amount.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    const bill = parseFloat(billInput.value);\n    const people = parseInt(peopleInput.value, 10);\n\n    if (isNaN(bill) || bill < 0 || isNaN(people) || people < 1) {\n      tipPerPersonEl.textContent = '$0.00';\n      totalPerPersonEl.textContent = '$0.00';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const tipAmount = bill * (selectedTip / 100);\n    const tipPerPerson = tipAmount / people;\n    const totalPerPerson = (bill + tipAmount) / people;\n\n    tipPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(tipPerPerson);\n    totalPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalPerPerson);\n  }\n\n  function setActiveTip(percent) {\n    selectedTip = percent;\n    tipButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n      const isActive = parseInt(btn.dataset.tip, 10) === percent;\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', isActive ? 'true' : 'false');\n    });\n    calculate();\n  }\n\n  tipButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      const percent = parseInt(btn.dataset.tip, 10);\n      setActiveTip(percent);\n    });\n  });\n\n  billInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n  peopleInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n\n  setActiveTip(15);\n})();",
      "description": "Calculation logic with rounding fix to avoid floating-point errors."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Tip Calculator\n\nA simple, offline tip calculator with a pixel-art aesthetic. Enter the bill amount, choose a tip percentage (10%, 15%, or 20%), and specify the number of people to see the tip and total per person.\n\n## Features\n\n- Bill amount input\n- Tip percentage buttons (10%, 15%, 20%)\n- Number of people input\n- Displays tip per person and total per person\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout (works from 360px width)\n- No external dependencies or network requests\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or build step required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – main HTML structure\n- `style.css` – pixel-art styling\n- `script.js` – calculation logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "Project documentation."
    }
  ]
}